==Notes==
*Despite its description, '''Cat's Eye''' adds 60 ''percentage points'' to a weapon's critical chance after other bonuses, similar to  {{Arcane|Arcane Avenger}}. This type of buff is commonly referred to as an ''absolute'' or ''final'' bonus.
*'''Cat's Eye''' stacks additively with other percentage point bonuses, such as {{Arcane|Arcane Avenger}}. For example, an {{Weapon|Atterax}} with a max rank {{M|True Steel}}, {{M|Blood Rush}} at a 4.0x combo multiplier, '''Cat's Eye''', and Arcane Avenger will have a {{Math|25% {{mul}} (1 + 120% + 40%{{mul}}(4 - 1)) + 60% + 45%|t = y|p = y}} critical chance.
**Highly effective with weapons with high critical damage multipliers.
*Emplaced [[turret]]s (i.e. the Grineer [[Rampart]]) gain the ability to critically strike while under the effect of Cat's Eye.
**While this also applies to weapons that cannot critically strike, these weapons often have a [[critical multiplier]] of 1.0x which yields no change in damage dealt.
*Multiple instances of Cat's Eye do '''not''' stack.
*The ability triggers when an enemy is within at least 25 meters.
*The cooldown of 20 seconds starts when Cat's Eye's duration stops. This leads to an effective uptime of {{Math|10 {{div}} (10 + 20)|round=0.01|p=y|t=y}}.
**The effective uptime with {{M|Tek Enhance}} will be {{Math|(10 {{mul}} (1+30%)) {{div}} (10 {{mul}} (1+30%) + 20)|round=0.01|p=y|t=y}}.

